    LLM: "1. Deal 4 each; turn trump. 2. Dealer: Raub (take trump, make 2) or Trick (7 up, make 1) before seeing hand. 3. Else bidding: 'I lead' = declarer; can exchange up to 4. 4. Defenders: Idem (play) or Nejdem (drop). Must make 1 if playing. 5. Play 4 tricks. 6. Scoring.",
